      "id": "concepts-java/value-semantics",
      "chapterId": "concepts-java/01-types",
      "title": "值语义与引用语义",
      "kind": "concept",
      "summary": "原始类型按值、对象按引用；包装类型的 == 比的是引用",
      "snippets": {
        "java": {
